#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:276
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_MayNiceBadgesTakeThis"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}! Long time no see!\p"
"Oh? While I visited the hot springs,\n"
"you got the LAVARIDGE GYM BADGE.\p"
"You must have collected\n"
"good POKéMON…\l"
"No, I believe you raised some.\p"
"I guess it would be okay for you to\n"
"have this.$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}！好久不见！\p"
"咦？我去泡温泉的时候，\n"
"你已经拿到釜炎道馆的徽章了啊。\p"
"你一定是收集到了很棒的宝可梦……\n"
"不对，我相信是你把它们培养得很棒。\p"
"这个应该可以送给你了吧。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:286
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_MayExplainGoGogglesChallengeDad"
msgid ""
"MAY: With those GO-GOGGLES, you'll\n"
"have no trouble getting through the\l"
"desert near ROUTE 111.\p"
"But, wow, {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"Challenging GYMS…\p"
"You're trying hard because you don't\n"
"want to lose to me, I bet!\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I think I should challenge\n"
"your dad in PETALBURG GYM.\p"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：有了GOGO护目镜，你就\n"
"能轻松穿过111号道路附近的沙漠了。\p"
"不过，哇，{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"你在挑战道馆啊……\p"
"我猜，你这么努力，\n"
"是因为不想输给我吧！\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，我想我也\n"
"该去橙华道馆挑战一下你爸爸了。\p"
"再见啦！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:298
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_BrendanNiceBadgesTakeThis"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}, hey, it's been a while.\n"
"How's it going?\p"
"Hmm…\n"
"That's a decent collection of BADGES.\p"
"All right, then.\n"
"You may as well have this.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：{PLAYER}，嘿，\n"
"好久不见了。最近怎么样？\p"
"嗯……你的徽章收集得还不错嘛。\p"
"好吧，那这个就送给你吧。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:306
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_BrendanExplainGoGogglesChallengeDad"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Keep those with you if you're\n"
"planning on going into that desert near\l"
"ROUTE 111.\p"
"There should be some POKéMON that\n"
"are exclusively desert-dwellers.\l"
"You might look around for those.\p"
"As for me…\n"
"I'm considering challenging NORMAN,\l"
"the GYM LEADER of PETALBURG.\p"
"Unlike you, {PLAYER}, your dad looks like\n"
"he really is tough.\p"
"See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：如果你打算去111号道路附近的\n"
"那片沙漠，就把这个带在身上吧。\p"
"那里应该有一些只栖息在沙漠里的\n"
"宝可梦。你可以找找看。\p"
"至于我嘛……我正在\n"
"考虑去挑战橙华道馆的馆主千里。\p"
"和你不一样，{PLAYER}，\n"
"你爸爸看起来是真的很强。\p"
"回头见！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:320
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_HaveEggWillYouTakeIt"
msgid ""
"I have here an EGG.\p"
"I'd hoped to hatch it by covering it in\n"
"hot sand by the hot springs.\l"
"But that doesn't seem to be enough…\p"
"I've heard it would be best if it were\n"
"kept together with POKéMON and\l"
"carried about.\p"
"You are a TRAINER, yes?\n"
"And your POKéMON radiate vitality.\p"
"So, what say you?\n"
"Will you take this EGG to hatch?$"
msgstr ""
"我这里有一颗蛋。\p"
"我本来想用温泉边的热沙把\n"
"它盖起来孵化，但好像还不够……\p"
"听说最好是和宝可梦放在一起，\n"
"带着它到处走。\p"
"你是训练家，对吧？\n"
"而且你的宝可梦都充满了活力。\p"
"那么，怎么样？你愿意带走这颗蛋，\n"
"把它孵出来吗？$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:333
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_HopeYoullWalkPlentyWithEgg"
msgid ""
"Good! I hope you'll walk plenty with\n"
"this here EGG!$"
msgstr "太好了！希望你带着这颗蛋多走走路！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:337
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_ReceivedTheEgg"
msgid "{PLAYER} received the EGG.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}得到了蛋。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:340
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_NoRoomForThisEgg"
msgid ""
"Oh? You've too many POKéMON.\n"
"There's no room for this EGG…$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀？你的宝可梦太多了。\n"
"没有地方放这颗蛋了……$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:344
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_AsYouWishThen"
msgid ""
"As you wish, then…\p"
"If you have a change of heart about\n"
"hatching this EGG, I will be here.$"
msgstr ""
"那就随你吧……\p"
"如果你改变主意，想要孵化这颗蛋，\n"
"我会一直在这里的。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:349
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_EverySoOftenEggFoundAtDayCare"
msgid ""
"Every so often, an EGG will be found at\n"
"the POKéMON DAY CARE.\p"
"Or at least that's how the rumor goes.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦寄放屋里时不时会发现蛋。\p"
"至少传闻是这么说的。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_HotSpringsNeverRunDry"
msgid ""
"We draw as much hot water as we need,\n"
"and yet the hot springs never run dry.\p"
"Isn't it magical?\p"
"These hot springs appear near active\n"
"volcanoes. Veins of water under the\l"
"ground are heated by magma to well up\l"
"as hot springs.$"
msgstr ""
"我们想用多少热水就打多少，\n"
"可温泉却从来不会干涸。\p"
"很神奇吧？\p"
"这种温泉出现在活火山附近。地下的水脉\n"
"被岩浆加热，就会涌出地面变成温泉。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:363
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_PokemonNippedBackside"
msgid ""
"Being buried in this hot sand is…\n"
"Sigh…\p"
"So warm and heavenly…\p"
"Eh? Gyaah! Ouch!\p"
"A POKéMON nipped my backside!$"
msgstr ""
"被埋在热沙里……啊……\p"
"好暖和，简直像在天堂……\p"
"嗯？呀啊！好痛！\p"
"有只宝可梦咬了我的屁股！$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:370
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_OhYouLikeHotSprings"
msgid ""
"Oh, you like hot springs, do you?\p"
"That's surprising for one as young\n"
"as you.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你喜欢温泉吗？\p"
"你年纪这么小，真让人意外。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:375
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_BatheInHotSpringsEveryDay"
msgid ""
"I bathe in the hot springs every day.\p"
"I want to become a beautiful and strong\n"
"GYM LEADER like FLANNERY.$"
msgstr ""
"我每天都泡温泉。\p"
"我想成为像亚莎那样又\n"
"漂亮又强大的道馆馆主。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:380
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_IfPokemonInHotSprings"
msgid ""
"If people put POKéMON in hot springs,\n"
"it might be seriously strange.\p"
"Why, it might be an electric bath, or\n"
"a bubble bath, or even a lava bath…$"
msgstr ""
"要是把宝可梦放进温泉里，\n"
"说不定会变得很奇怪。\p"
"哎呀，说不定会变成电气浴、\n"
"泡泡浴，甚至是熔岩浴……$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:386
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_HotSpringsClaims"
msgid ""
"They're claiming that these hot springs\n"
"are good for calming nervous tension,\l"
"relieving aching muscles, solving\l"
"romantic problems, and attracting\l"
"money…$"
msgstr ""
"据说这里的温泉可以舒缓紧张情绪、缓解\n"
"肌肉酸痛、解决恋爱烦恼，还能招财……$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:393
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_TownSign"
msgid ""
"LAVARIDGE TOWN\p"
"“POKéMON CENTER HOT SPRINGS\n"
"An excellent place for relaxing!”$"
msgstr ""
"釜炎乡\p"
"“宝可梦中心温泉\n"
"最适合放松身心的地方！”$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_GymSign"
msgid ""
"LAVARIDGE TOWN POKéMON GYM\n"
"LEADER: FLANNERY\l"
"“One with a fiery passion that burns!”$"
msgstr ""
"釜炎乡宝可梦道馆\n"
"道馆馆主：亚莎\l"
"“燃烧着火热激情的人！”$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc:403
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_Text_HerbShopSign"
msgid ""
"POKéMON HERB SHOP\n"
"“Bitter taste--better cure!”$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦草药店\n"
"“良药苦口利于病！”$"
